    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107151" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεξαίρ-εσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>removal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἀλγοῦντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαίρεσις</span> a better
			reading, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.Lac.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1012.23
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἀλλοτρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					14.681
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀποφατικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					2.84
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεθ᾽ ὑπεξαιρέσεως</span> with
				<i>a reservation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epict.
				<u>Ench.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				4.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.149
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				12.21
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.52
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθ᾽ ὑπεξαίρεσίν τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					8.479
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶχεν ὑ. τοῦ μὴ ὅμοιον
			εἶναι</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				205.21
			</span></i>: hence in Rhet., <i>a treating as exceptional,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>refutation,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίστις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.202
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
